  "description": "I feel better when I'm on the pole! \n\nDespite the taboo surrounding it, pole dancing is one of the most vigorous physical exercises out there. Though initially self-conscious about her new hobby, our protagonist learns to love her own body and herself through the art of pole dancing. So, then... Shall we dance? \n\n(Source: Manta)",
